          "type": "heading",
          "text": "1. How It Scales",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "==City cells==: own DBs and Kafka, so a failure hits **one** city",
            "Pre-scale before lunch and dinner on a schedule",
            "Autoscale on ==queue lag== and CPU for surprise surges",
            "Shed load: promos and recs first, then search, then checkout; protect **order placement** last"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
