        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "2. How It Survives",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "yaml",
          "lines": [
            "timeout_ms: 300",
            "retries: 2",
            "retry_jitter: true",
            "retry_budget: 10%",
            "breaker: open at 50% errors",
            "bulkhead: 20 threads per dep"
          ],
          "note": "retries without a budget amplify outages"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Timeouts of ==200-500 ms== on every call",
            "Circuit breaker and bulkhead **per dependency**",
            "Stale menu if catalog is down; static ETA if the model is down",
            "Push fails, then fall back to ==SMS==",
            "Multi-AZ replicas, auto failover: RPO ~0 for orders, RTO under 5 min"
          ],
          "style": "dot",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
