          "type": "heading",
          "text": "4. Common Mistakes",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "No ==idempotency== on payments: retries double-charge",
            "No ==timeouts== on gateways: threads pile up",
            "One Kafka partition key: **hot partition**, lag spikes"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
